(2, 36, 'Ipratropium bromide is used in the management of:', '["Acute gastroenteritis", "Acute peptic ulcer disease", "Acute bronchopneumonia", "Acute asthmatic attack"]'::jsonb, 3),
(2, 37, 'Salbutamol relieves bronchospasm mainly by acting as a:', '["Beta-2 adrenergic agonist causing bronchial smooth muscle relaxation", "Anticholinergic that dries secretions", "Corticosteroid reducing inflammation only", "Mucolytic that thins mucus"]'::jsonb, 0),
