(2, 39, 'Before administering any weight-based critical care drug infusion, best practice is to:', '["Skip verification if the nurse is experienced", "Have the calculation independently double-checked by a second nurse/pharmacist", "Round the dose up for safety margin", "Administer without checking the infusion pump rate"]'::jsonb, 1),
