(2, 47, 'Which of the following is an example of internet browser?', '["Microsoft Word", "Notepad", "Internet navigator", "Internet explorer"]'::jsonb, 3),
(2, 48, 'A nurse is using an Electronic Health Record (EHR) to access a patient''s lab results. The EHR system provides a centralized location for patient data, which helps to:', '["Increase the time it takes to retrieve patient data", "Ensure each department uses its own unique record system", "Improve continuity of care and coordination among the healthcare team", "Eliminate the need for any verbal communication between nurses"]'::jsonb, 2),
