(2, 56, 'A patient with respiratory failure is receiving oxygenation and ventilation support. The nurse knows that the main goal of this therapy is to:', '["Keep the patient asleep and comfortable", "Reduce the workload of the heart", "Reverse the underlying cause of the respiratory failure", "Maintain adequate gas exchange and support vital organ function"]'::jsonb, 3),
