(2, 149, 'The APGAR score evaluates a newborn''s condition based on which five components?', '["Appearance, pulse, grimace, activity, and respiration", "Airway, pulse, glucose, activity, respiration", "Appearance, position, glucose, activity, reflex", "Alertness, pain, growth, appetite, reflex"]'::jsonb, 0),
