(2, 151, 'Which of the following is NOT one of the environmental components Nightingale identified as essential to a healthy healing environment?', '["Pure/fresh air and proper ventilation", "Adequate light, especially direct sunlight", "Noise control and quiet", "Strict bedrest for all patients regardless of condition"]'::jsonb, 3),
(2, 152, 'When selecting nursing interventions, the nurse should consider all of the following EXCEPT:', '["The desired client outcome", "Evidence-based practice and research support", "The nurse''s personal convenience over client needs", "The client''s preferences and resources"]'::jsonb, 2),
