(2, 161, 'A nurse formulates the nursing diagnosis ''Risk for infection related to invasive lines'' for a critically ill patient. This is an example of which type of nursing diagnosis?', '["An actual nursing diagnosis, describing a current problem", "A risk nursing diagnosis, describing vulnerability to a potential problem rather than a current one", "A wellness diagnosis", "Not a valid nursing diagnosis format"]'::jsonb, 1),
