(2, 163, 'Which of the following is the most accurate definition of research?', '["A systematic, rigorous and logical process of inquiry that seeks to answer questions and generate new knowledge", "The act of reading widely around a clinical topic before writing a report", "Any opinion a nurse forms after observing a patient once", "A collection of anecdotes gathered from colleagues about a clinical practice"]'::jsonb, 0),
(2, 164, 'Serum potassium level measured in mmol/L is an example of which scale of measurement?', '["Nominal", "Ordinal", "Interval", "Ratio"]'::jsonb, 3),
