(2, 171, 'The first page of the research report is', '["Appendix", "Bibliography", "Index", "Title Page"]'::jsonb, 3),
(2, 172, 'The science of collectiong, organizing, analyzing, interpreting and presenting data to asist in making more effective decisions is known as:', '["Data", "Inference", "Statistics.", "Sample"]'::jsonb, 2),
(2, 173, 'The ''back matter'' of a research report typically includes:', '["Reference, Bibliography, and Appendix", "Only the title page", "The introduction and literature review", "The abstract only"]'::jsonb, 0),
(2, 174, 'The ''5 Rights of Delegation'' include right task, right circumstance, right person, right direction/communication, and:', '["Right documentation only", "Right supervision/evaluation", "Right payment", "Right uniform"]'::jsonb, 1),
