(2, 177, 'If a nurse witnesses another staff member committing a serious, unsafe practice violation, the appropriate ethical action is to:', '["Ignore it to avoid conflict", "Report it through appropriate institutional and/or regulatory channels", "Only discuss it informally with friends", "Confront the colleague publicly in front of patients"]'::jsonb, 1),
