(3, 91, 'Unconsciousness include all the following EXCEPT', '["A state of abnormal cerebral activity", "Unresponsive to internal and external environmental changes", "Depression of cerebral function", "Awareness of self and environment"]'::jsonb, 3),
(3, 92, 'A nurse is performing hygiene care for an unconscious patient. To prevent complications, the nurse should:', '["Bathe the patient with cold water to stimulate a response", "Use a cotton swab to clean the patient''s ears", "Ensure the patient''s head is elevated to at least 30 degrees during care", "Use a firm bristle toothbrush to clean the teeth"]'::jsonb, 2),
