(3, 98, 'A patient in the ICU is agitated, disoriented, and pulling at IV lines. The nurse FIRST:', '["Administers haloperidol", "Applies restraints", "Assesses for pain or urinary retention", "Increases sedation"]'::jsonb, 2),
