(4, 36, 'When titrating sedation in a mechanically ventilated ICU patient, the nurse should primarily use:', '["The patient''s family''s preference alone", "A validated sedation scale (e.g. RASS) to guide titration", "No formal scale — sedation should be maximised at all times", "Blood pressure alone as the only guide"]'::jsonb, 1),
