(4, 39, 'Hypnotic drugs, as a pharmacological class, are primarily used to:', '["Induce and maintain sleep", "Treat hypertension", "Reverse anticoagulation", "Increase heart rate"]'::jsonb, 0),
(4, 40, 'The antidote for paracetamol overdose is:', '["Flumazenil", "Acetylcysteine", "Naloxone", "Atropine"]'::jsonb, 1),
