(4, 43, 'Mediastinal change seen in massive pleural effusion on a chest radiograph', '["Shift of mediastinum to the site of effusion", "Central mediastinum", "Shift of the mediastinum to the opposite", "Tracheal shift to the site of lesion"]'::jsonb, 2),
