(4, 48, 'System software, as distinct from application software, is best described as:', '["Software written by end users for a single specific task", "Software that manages computer hardware and provides a platform for other programs to run (e.g. an operating system)", "Software used exclusively for entertainment", "A type of computer virus"]'::jsonb, 1),
