(4, 57, 'A patient with a haemothorax and hypovolemic shock requires which priority intervention alongside chest tube drainage?', '["Diuretic therapy", "Fluid resuscitation and blood product transfusion as indicated", "Immediate extubation", "Withholding IV access until surgery"]'::jsonb, 1),
