(4, 63, 'What is the appropriate amount of time to suction a patient in a single interval?', '["No more than 20 – 30 seconds", "No more than 10 – 20 seconds", "No more than 5 – 10 seconds", "No more than 10 – 15 seconds"]'::jsonb, 3),
