(4, 73, 'A first-degree heart block on ECG is characterised by:', '["Complete dissociation between P waves and QRS complexes", "A prolonged PR interval with every P wave still followed by a QRS complex", "Absent P waves entirely", "A widened QRS with no P waves"]'::jsonb, 1),
