(7, 102, 'Which weaning parameter reflects a patient''s inspiratory muscle strength and ability to generate adequate negative pressure?', '["Positive end-expiratory pressure", "FiO2", "Negative inspiratory force (NIF)/maximal inspiratory pressure (MIP)", "I:E ratio"]'::jsonb, 2),
